      "writtenOn": "2023-02-13T18:37:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As we get more information from Analogix, it looks like this register is mainly a status register. It is used to enable I2C register access (instead of pin control), but polarity, USB3, TBT, DP, and USB4 bits are read only and reflect the current status.",
      "range": {
